WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:03.754
After all these year
there is nothing

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:06.423
until today.

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:10.219
All these signs,

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:12.179
something bigger.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:15.807
Maybe this is the
point to all of this.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:25.067
This show is a drama
set against the backdrop

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:27.110
of a massive alien
invasion of earth.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.656
One of the goals we
had of this show

00:00:30.656 --> 00:00:34.868
is to immerse the
audience in a visceral,

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:38.622
emotional, intense
survival situation.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.790
We need to get home.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.335
The whole world is falling apart

00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:46.672
and its affecting people
in different ways everywhere,

00:00:46.672 --> 00:00:48.048
it's incredible.

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:53.428
It's amazing to see
how the characters

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:54.888
evolved through this show

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:57.975
They’re battling the elements,

00:00:57.975 --> 00:00:59.309
and Trevante a navy seal,

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:00.519
I mean he’s seen a lot of stuff.

00:01:00.519 --> 00:01:01.395
Hello!

00:01:01.395 --> 00:01:04.064
But to experience the fact that
the world’s been invaded,

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:05.816
that’s new for everybody.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:12.239
Invasion is a story
about family.

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:14.199
It’s a story about our
shared humanity.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:16.576
All of our characters
are outsiders,

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:18.662
dealing with their own
version of alienation.

00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:24.501
We wanted all of
these emotional stories,

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:28.797
magnified by this
global traumatic event.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:32.092
To be able to see the
different vantage points

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:33.510
but everything is
interconnected,

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.636
the show is incredible.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.015
They’re here to take us.

00:01:39.016 --> 00:01:40.392
This is a very interesting show.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.604
It’s much more
than simple sci-fi.

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:45.480
Come on now!

00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:47.482
We don’t know what it wants.

00:01:47.983 --> 00:01:49.609
I think it's something
you’ve never seen before.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:50.819
It’s super cool.

00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:52.988
It’s the mystery;
it’s what you don’t know.

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:54.740
That’s a scary thing.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:01.288
[heavy breathing]

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:03.123
[slam] [screams]

